r both power and speed but only a 1  out of 5 for intelligence the name of  this quirk is muscle augmentation its  type is transformation and it works at  close range  his quirk enables muscular to transform  or augments his muscle fibers in order  to become both stronger and faster this  quirk is incredibly powerful when it  comes to physical strength it allows him  to smash rocks to bit and he was even  able to take the force of that whose  100% the Troy smash without suffering  any significant injuries he lost his eye  in a battle against two pro heroes while  trying to attack a village in the battle  muscular actually murdered both heroes  but after the battle he was too injured  to continue attacking the village next  is mustard a teen villain with a rather  unique look  mustard is known for wearing a school  uniform along with a gas mask and a  green army helmet he carries a revolver  pistol as a weapon and he isn't afraid  to use it  his quirk is referred to as sleep gas  its type is emitter and it works a long  range this quirk enables mustard to  create a gas that puts people to sleep  he is able to control the gas and he can  also sense the movement of anyone who is  located inside the zone where the gas  has spread as he is not immune to the  effects of his own quirk mustard has to  wear a gas mask and if he himself is  incapacitated then the gas will  disappear  his name is likely a reference to  mustard gas a deadly chemical weapon  first used by the German army in World  War one the military helmet that mustard  wears could be based on German military  helmet then we have mod named Magnus  real name is Kenji Hickey sheep and he  is easily recognized by his large list  and long red hair known for his  ruthlessness and cruelty magnet was a  hardened criminal who committed multiple  robberies and murders before joining the  league of villains the name of his quirk  is magnetism and this quirk enables  magnet to magnetize everyone within a  four and a half