encing  chrono stasis so I wonder could his name  be a hint that chrono stasis possesses a  quirk that can slow down time this would  certainly explain his health and if true  it would be one of the absolutely  coolest quirks in my hero academia and  finally we have mimicked the general  manager of the eight presets of death  and a loyal follower of overhaul mimic  has a quirk called mimicry and its type  is emitter this quirk gives him the  ability to possess objects and to  control them the size of an object he  can possess is said to be no bigger than  a refrigerator but the quirk boosting  drug known as trigger allows him to  possess much larger object and even an  entire basement floor and these are the  three most notable members of the eight  precepts of that but there are other  members as well although the information  we have on them so far is limited if you  would like to see a special video about  the eight precepts of death in the  future as we learn more about them be  sure to let me know down below and that  is it for this video guys thank you so  much for watching and thanks to Sol  mock-up from our discord server for  helping me out with this video I know  that we covered a lot of villains in  this video but I hope that having them  all here in one place will be useful for  you and if you want to see any of the  villains described in greater  detail like we did with hero killer  Spain let me know down in the comments  if you enjoyed this video and want to  see more my hero academia videos be sure  to 100% that Troy smash that like button  and if you are new to the channel be  sure to subscribe and hit that  notification valve if you'd like to chat  with us about anime on a daily basis you  can join our discord server the link is  in the description and until next time  see us space Cowboys  [Music]  [Applause]  [Music]
 

